OL,3,GNEWSABuilding mural of WW2 hero who
OL,4,Adied at 110 finished
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mural on the side of a town hall
OL,7,Fcommemorating Donald Rose, who was the
OL,8,FUK's oldest surviving World War Two
OL,9,Fveteran before his death in July 2025
OL,10,Faged 110, has been completed.
OL,12,FRose served as a sniper in the Queen's
OL,13,FRoyal Regiment and survived a bullet
OL,14,Fwound to the leg during the D-Day
OL,15,Flandings.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
